      "code": "# 130. 被围绕的区域\n# 把所有被 X 完全围绕的 O 翻转为 X\n# 与边界连通的 O 保持不变（不能被完全围绕）\n#\n# 关键观察:\n#   只有「不与边界连通」的 O 才被翻转\n#\n# 示例:\n#   board = [\n#     [\"X\",\"X\",\"X\",\"X\"],\n#     [\"X\",\"O\",\"O\",\"X\"],\n#     [\"X\",\"X\",\"O\",\"X\"],\n#     [\"X\",\"O\",\"X\",\"X\"]\n#   ]\n#   结果: [\n#     [\"X\",\"X\",\"X\",\"X\"],\n#     [\"X\",\"X\",\"X\",\"X\"],\n#     [\"X\",\"X\",\"X\",\"X\"],\n#     [\"X\",\"O\",\"X\",\"X\"]\n#   ]\n\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef solve(board: List[List[str]]) -> None:\n    \"\"\"原地翻转被围绕的 O 区域\"\"\"\n    if not board or not board[0]:\n        return\n    m, n = len(board), len(board[0])\n    def dfs(i: int, j: int) -> None:\n        if i < 0 or i >= m or j < 0 or j >= n or board[i][j] != 'O':\n            return\n        board[i][j] = 'S'  # 标记为「安全」（与边界连通）\n        dfs(i + 1, j)\n        dfs(i - 1, j)\n        dfs(i, j + 1)\n        dfs(i, j - 1)",
